    {
      "source": "If the <a href=\"WebServerInitializedEvent.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.web.server.context\"><code>WebServerInitializedEvent</code></a> has a\n<a href=\"WebServerApplicationContext.html#getServerNamespace()\"><code>server namespace</code></a>, it will be\nused to construct the property name. For example, the \"management\" actuator context\nwill have the property name \"local.management.port\".",
      "translation": "如果 <a href=\"WebServerInitializedEvent.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.web.server.context\"><code>WebServerInitializedEvent</code></a> 具有\n<a href=\"WebServerApplicationContext.html#getServerNamespace()\"><code>server namespace</code></a>，则它将用于构建属性名称。例如，\"management\" 监控上下文将具有属性名称 \"local.management.port\"。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
